  "title": "EvoIR-Agent: Self-Evolving Image Restoration Agentic System via Experience-Driven Learning",
  "summary": "EvoIR-Agent enables autonomous image restoration agents to dynamically select tools and determine removal orders, improving performance in degradation coupling scenarios. It introduces a training-free paradigm with a hierarchical experience pool and a self-evolving mechanism to enhance efficiency and adaptability.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "EvoIR-Agent introduces a training-free image restoration agent with a hierarchical experience pool and a self-evolving mechanism to improve performance.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "Extensive experiments show that EvoIR-Agent achieves a 61% efficiency improvement and a Pareto-optimal balance in performance.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The system reduces trial-and-error overhead by leveraging accumulated experience and dynamically adapting to new tools and degradation scenarios.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    }
